# Work on main

- Do all implementation on `main`. Do not create a feature branch, `cursor/*` snapshot branch, or pull-request branch unless the user explicitly asks for one.
- Commit and push to `main`.
- If a temporary branch already exists, merge it into `main`, then delete the local and remote copies. Do not keep Cursor snapshot branches around.
